Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:19.34,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I, Renato di Rubini, first prince \Nof the Kingdom of Rubini,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:23.63,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,hereby call off our engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:30.57,italics,MARIA/NA,0,0,0,,It began with a sudden end\Nto an engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:36.02,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs27\3c&HF4F3FC&}Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:36.02,sign_Georgia,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(319,260)\fs22\c&H080600&\bord0\shad0}How I {\c&HD49E5B&}Searched {\c&H080600&}For A Promising Catch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:38.64,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(774,1)\pos(320,257)\c&H080600&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\fs25}Kingdom of Rubini Royal Capital
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.82,0:00:49.84,main,DRIVER,0,0,0,,Duke Annovazzi's carriage has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.63,0:01:05.75,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.75,0:01:07.25,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Aida!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:14.14,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,It's been so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:15.90,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You seem well, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:19.23,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Has it been two years? \NI'm so glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:31.40,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H414FF5&\3c&H4138B5&\4c&H424AA9&\pos(106,12)}SHAKE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:31.40,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H414FF5&\3c&H4138B5&\4c&H424AA9&\pos(518,28)}SHAKE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:25.82,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Duke Ametis! Thank you \Nfor agreeing to be my guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:27.97,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,My father sends his regards as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.97,0:01:31.40,main,DUKE AMETIS,0,0,0,,W-Welcome to the Ametis \Nfamily home, Lady Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:32.76,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.76,0:01:34.70,main,DRIVER,0,0,0,,Milady!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.41,0:01:38.23,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:42.24,main,DUKE AMETIS,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, Lady Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:47.07,main,DUKE AMETIS,0,0,0,,Your magnanimous personality \Nhas saved Aida countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:49.26,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:51.99,main,DUKE AMETIS,0,0,0,,I hope you'll continue to be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.99,0:01:56.21,main,DUKE AMETIS,0,0,0,,That said, Aida is no longer \Nmerely my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.21,0:01:59.48,main,DUKE AMETIS,0,0,0,,I ask that you use your discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.48,0:02:05.00,main,DUKE AMETIS,0,0,0,,You can't suddenly take her \Nto faraway places like you once did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:07.82,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,This is the Kingdom of Rubini, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:11.78,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,We can't do what we did back in the \NKingdom of Muro where Mimi's from.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:14.97,main,DUKE AMETIS,0,0,0,,I'm just worried about you, Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.97,0:02:17.90,main,DUKE AMETIS,0,0,0,,You'll become a royal soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.90,0:02:20.49,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Please, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:28.50,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H030F15&\3c&H25FFF7&\shad0\bord3}BLAZE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:25.08,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,You can count on me, Your Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:28.50,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I'll protect Aida with all my might!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:34.54,main,DUKE AMETIS,0,0,0,,Ah, I have an audience \Nwith His Majesty now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:38.54,main,DUKE AMETIS,0,0,0,,Lady Maria, please make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:41.54,main,DUKE AMETIS,0,0,0,,Aida, I leave the rest in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:44.59,main,DRIVER,0,0,0,,She screwed up already...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.94,0:02:48.27,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry my father \Nwas rude to you, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.27,0:02:49.55,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,It's totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.55,0:02:54.23,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,More importantly, Aida, didn't you \Nget engaged to the Prince of Rubini?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.23,0:02:56.36,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,What's he like? How'd you meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.36,0:02:57.71,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Aw, shucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.71,0:03:02.83,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Our families may be distantly \Nrelated, but I'm still proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:04.46,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it, Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:09.28,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,My father forced it to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:11.97,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,What?! Then how do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:15.97,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I'm very honored, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:19.11,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'd pay dearly if I refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:27.97,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'd rather hear about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.97,0:03:29.93,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Why did you suddenly \Ndecide to study abroad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.93,0:03:31.90,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Don't you need to look after your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:33.19,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Don't they need you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.35,0:03:37.86,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Aida, I'm here to find a promising catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.51,0:03:41.28,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,A promising catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:44.50,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I believe I told you in my letter...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:47.37,flashback,ALL,0,0,0,,One, two, three! One—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:50.71,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(265,15)\c&H48E0FA&\3c&H08AEE4&\shad0\bord3}RUMBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:50.71,flashback,MAID,0,0,0,,Milady! Lady Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:56.47,flashback,MAID,0,0,0,,A young master's been born.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:58.19,flashback,MAID,0,0,0,,You have a younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:03:59.64,flashback,MARIA,0,0,0,,A younger brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.63,0:04:07.60,flashback,MARIA MOTHER,0,0,0,,Mimi, this is your younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.13,0:04:13.31,flashback,MARIA,0,0,0,,He's so soft and warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:20.99,flashback,DUKE ANNOVAZZI,0,0,0,,F-Fantastic! I have an heir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:23.91,flashback,DUKE ANNOVAZZI,0,0,0,,Mimi, go find a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:26.36,flashback,DUKE ANNOVAZZI,0,0,0,,The most promising one you can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.36,0:04:29.05,flashback,DUKE ANNOVAZZI,0,0,0,,find... {\fs20}find... {\fs16}find...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.05,0:04:33.04,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I don't believe it. I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:35.31,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:37.59,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Sorry? Why are you sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:43.63,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Because you've worked so hard \Nto become the Annovazzi family heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:46.18,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Your studies, practice, and training...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:49.40,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You've learned so many things \Na lady normally wouldn't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:52.78,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Oh, I'd hardly call them unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:56.14,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,They're all useful life skills \Neven if I'm not the heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:57.03,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:06.43,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,A male heir is preferred, but my \Nparents only had girls until recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:08.70,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I just happen to be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:11.09,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You make it sound so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:15.67,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Because my dream isn't to \Ntake over the Annovazzi family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.27,0:05:23.28,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Nothing would please me more than \NTeo becoming a marvelous heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:26.28,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,What could be better \Nthan everyone finding joy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:28.22,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,That sounds very like you, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:31.81,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,His freeloading big sister \Ncan't hang around forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.81,0:05:35.16,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,So I have to find a promising catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:37.48,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You're not looking in your local area?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.77,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I already did!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.77,0:05:44.43,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,But all the suitable matches were taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.43,0:05:47.36,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just not very popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:49.15,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.15,0:05:51.15,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I spoke my mind again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:52.88,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,That's a bad habit of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:58.22,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Anyway, that's why I'm here studying \Nabroad to find a promising catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.22,0:06:00.42,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I hope you find someone nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:04.76,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I should show you around \Nthe royal academy first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.76,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:13.19,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,This was originally a school \Nexclusively for royals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:17.06,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,But two generations ago, \Nthe king decided it would be best
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:21.28,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,if they studied alongside nobles \Nand began admitting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:26.62,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,It's good for nobles to get to \Nknow each other from a young age.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:28.56,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.34,0:06:34.54,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Everyone's so polite. Is it because \Nyou're engaged to the prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:37.67,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:46.28,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Hey, Aida. Is that a transfer student?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:50.42,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Yes, she is. Let me introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:53.57,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,This is Maria Annovazzi. This is—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:55.77,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. Call me Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:57.52,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,The prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:00.31,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,The prince?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:02.53,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,So, His Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:06.68,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Call me Placido.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.24,0:07:09.83,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I see. So you're Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:11.67,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I'm delighted to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:14.27,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Aida's told me all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:16.27,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:20.25,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I told him you're my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:25.35,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Your family hosted Aida to help \Nwith her asthma, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.35,0:07:30.32,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I heard she wasn't sure if you \Nwere a boy or girl at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:31.26,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:32.97,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:36.32,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I didn't know how to \Nwear dresses back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:39.06,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,In fact, I still struggle with them today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:40.15,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.27,0:07:43.60,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Truly, you exceed my expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:45.61,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,No wonder you're Aida's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:47.97,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,What? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:52.36,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I know what I'm like, but Aida is \Nthe most ladylike of all ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.36,0:07:53.70,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:08:00.13,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(200,20)\c&H4538F5&\3c&H3019E0&\shad0}BONK BONK
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.15,0:07:58.49,overlap,AIDA,0,0,0,,Stay away from me! Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.65,0:07:58.49,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,At first, Aida threw chestnuts at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.49,0:08:00.13,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,She didn't even remove the husks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:01.92,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,What? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:07.56,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,That's because you teased me \Nabout being a greedy glutton.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.56,0:08:10.15,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Not to mention that was \Nmore than ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.15,0:08:15.32,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I'm surprised. I thought \NAida was a natural-born lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:17.06,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Please, no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:24.91,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:27.54,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I understand your \Nsituation and goals now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:30.60,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I'll find some promising \Nyoung lords for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.60,0:08:33.83,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Really? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:36.70,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:43.82,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Did he not hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:45.34,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:49.46,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I don't think Prince Renato will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.83,0:08:56.05,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,No luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:09:01.08,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I wanted to introduce Mimi, \Nbut he said he had work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:04.61,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,He seems busier than ever recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:11.87,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Well, my brother's far more talented \Nthan me, but he can be a bit inflexible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.87,0:09:14.12,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,He's a perfectionist and workaholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:17.79,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,His aide, Raimondo, asked me \Nto help my brother, so I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.17,0:09:20.55,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,See you later, Aida and Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.71,0:09:25.34,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Have you seen enough of the academy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.82,0:09:27.34,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:30.04,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:32.84,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,Shame on you for making a ruckus here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:35.94,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Please forgive her, Lady Eleonora.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.94,0:09:38.05,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,I offer my apologies as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:43.55,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,I can't reject an apology from \Nthe fiancée of the Prince of Rubini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.97,0:09:47.52,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,That would make me the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.52,0:09:50.09,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,Do be careful from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:55.39,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,What unbelievable strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.39,0:09:56.49,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Don't mind her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:10:00.40,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Lady Eleonora just \Nspeaks that way sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:05.29,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Right. She seemed reluctant, \Nbut she did forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:16.14,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,Aida seems friendly with Prince Placido, \Nbut he's not her fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:21.48,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,That must mean she's engaged to \Nhis older brother, Prince Renato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:25.89,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,But she doesn't seem happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.88,0:10:30.07,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I need to find my own promising catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.02,0:10:39.03,sign_Georgia,,0,0,0,,{\c&H141824&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\an1\frz11.98\pos(367,247)}Always a {\c&H8873F3&}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.29,0:10:34.23,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:44.39,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,How are you, Father and Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:47.75,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,I've been studying abroad \Nfor two months, and I feel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.75,0:10:51.42,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,Aida treats me well, \Nand I've made friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:54.08,flashback,LADY 1,0,0,0,,How do you do, Lady Annovazzi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.08,0:10:57.43,flashback,LORD 1,0,0,0,,I heard you're staying \Nwith Duke Ametis's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.43,0:10:59.27,flashback,LADY 2,0,0,0,,Are you free today, milady?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.27,0:11:01.64,flashback,LORD 2,0,0,0,,Where is Lady Aida today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:08.39,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're great people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:10.73,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,I need more time to find a fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.81,0:11:27.79,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Oh? Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:29.51,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Prince Placido.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:33.13,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Where's Aida? She's not with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:36.51,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,She's had a fever since last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.51,0:11:39.05,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,It's a shame, but she's \Nskipping the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:42.01,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I see. I'm worried about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:45.27,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Right? I'm sure you're \Nvery worried about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:47.44,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,O-Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.31,0:11:52.07,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.62,0:11:55.40,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Lady Maria Annovazzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:12:01.02,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Would you honor me, \NPlacido di Rubini, with a dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:06.78,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,What?! But I'm not used to dancing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:09.00,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I'd only cause you trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:13.50,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,It's all right. The important thing \Nis that you have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.93,0:12:19.76,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:46.58,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:12:57.55,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I'm hungry after that workout.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.49,0:13:02.83,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Aida is lucky to have a friend like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.86,0:13:08.09,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I believe Aida went to stay \Nwith you in the first place
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:12.59,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,because she exhausted herself \Nstudying to be ladylike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:15.90,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,It's probably the reason \Nfor today's absence as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.90,0:13:18.06,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,That's news to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.06,0:13:21.82,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Aida's always been \Na perfectly put together lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.13,0:13:28.10,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,I think you're helping Aida \Na lot just by being with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.10,0:13:31.33,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty. I'll protect Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.33,0:13:33.54,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,That's encouraging.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:38.69,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Perhaps she'll recover if they \Nformally announce their engagement
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.69,0:13:40.97,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,at the graduation party.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:43.83,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Graduation party?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.38,0:13:48.56,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,The students one year \Nabove us are graduating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.23,0:13:52.75,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Prince Renato will be the center \Nof attention this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:57.32,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,The remaining students \Nare also allowed to attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.74,0:14:00.71,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I bet it's a luxurious party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:05.74,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Today's party was amazing, too. \NAll the steak you can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:07.97,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:11.18,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Also, Prince Placido is really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:12.21,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,He really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:15.96,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Hey, Aida, do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.90,0:14:22.97,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Uh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.97,0:14:27.99,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,All right! I'll work hard \Nto find a fiancé at the party!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.99,0:14:31.93,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You'll need to control your \Nhabit of speaking your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:34.02,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:37.55,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,While learning to be ladylike with Aida,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.55,0:14:40.61,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,I wait for Prince Placido \Nto introduce me to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.61,0:14:44.93,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,Teo, make sure you listen to Father, \NMother, and your older sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.93,0:14:46.45,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.45,0:14:47.43,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:58.65,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.71,0:15:05.97,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Your hair glitters \Nlike autumn wheat, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:09.89,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,It's not as smooth or glossy \Nas your blonde hair, Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.89,0:15:16.58,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,It's, uh, a beautiful golden... \Ngold color.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:20.94,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Thank you. We'll work on your language \Nskills when we get back from the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.37,0:15:25.29,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Okay, that should do it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.39,0:15:36.02,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,You don't need to ride \Nwith Prince Renato?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.02,0:15:37.62,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Isn't he your fiancé?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:41.69,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,He's a very busy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.13,0:15:45.41,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I see. I guess he is a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.41,0:15:48.64,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,If it were me, I'd kick \Ndown the door to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:50.53,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Oh, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.83,0:15:56.98,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:03.70,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,That's Lady Eleonora's carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.70,0:16:08.49,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Eleonora? Oh, the girl I bumped into.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.39,0:16:12.72,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Lady Eleonora, what \Nseems to be the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:15.00,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,Ugh! Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:16.62,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HC3A07E&\3c&HF3F5F4&\shad0\fs25\fad(224,1)}SNEAK
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:16.58,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,If your carriage is damaged—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:20.25,main,ELEONORA,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me? \NI don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.74,0:16:22.20,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Aida...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.85,0:16:26.04,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,My apologies. If you'll excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:36.64,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I wonder if that carriage will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:40.90,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,That's what I like about you, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:41.88,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:47.82,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Well, I like how you never \Nspeak poorly of anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:50.42,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:11.18,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Look at all these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:14.92,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Isn't that the minister \Nof the Kingdom of Kihaus?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:17.56,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Even he's attending this party?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:20.69,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Your father's here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.59,0:17:28.30,main,ANNOUNCE,0,0,0,,Announcing First Prince Renato \Nand Second Prince Placido.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.74,0:17:38.58,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\move(175,110,175,80)\c&HA0A3F5&\3c&H5142CA&\shad0\fs25}SWOON
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.74,0:17:38.58,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\move(500,85,505,50)\c&HA0A3F5&\3c&H5142CA&\shad0\fs25\frz-17.99}SWOON
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:44.54,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H8D6FF3&\3c&H635696&\shad0\bord3\move(400,135,400,95)\fs30}SWOON
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.98,0:17:38.58,main,LADY 1,0,0,0,,He's always so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.89,0:17:44.54,main,LADY 2,0,0,0,,After graduation, he'll be declared \Ncrown prince, won't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:46.84,main,LADY 3,0,0,0,,Even his furrowed brow is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.84,0:17:49.42,main,LADY 4,0,0,0,,Prince Placido is charming as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.19,0:17:59.25,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Why is Prince Renato escorting \Nsomeone other than his fiancée?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:04.09,main,LADY 1,0,0,0,,You're not having him \Nescort you, Lady Aida?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.09,0:18:06.40,main,LADY 2,0,0,0,,Lady Eleonora is with him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:08.64,main,LADY 3,0,0,0,,And he's ignoring his fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:12.19,main,LADY 4,0,0,0,,I heard your relationship with \NPrince Renato is not going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:13.37,main,LADY 5,0,0,0,,You poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:15.77,main,LADY 6,0,0,0,,You can talk to me \Nif there's anything on your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:23.94,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Aida, I'm thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.94,0:18:26.03,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Let's go to the garden and drink our fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:31.97,main,LADY 1,0,0,0,,But we had more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.27,0:18:35.77,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.47,0:18:39.09,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,I can't believe they'd ask \Nthose insensitive questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.09,0:18:41.36,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,They can't call themselves ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:42.98,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Oh, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.98,0:18:46.33,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Everyone's interested in Prince Renato.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:49.23,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,That means they're \Ninterested in me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.34,0:18:55.49,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,But isn't it exhausting not knowing \Nif they actually care about you or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.11,0:18:58.33,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.33,0:19:03.12,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Well, I only speak the truth, \Nso don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.48,0:19:06.38,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,You should work on your phrasing, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:07.38,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.40,0:19:12.82,main,LADY 1,0,0,0,,Prince Renato?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.82,0:19:14.91,main,LADY 2,0,0,0,,He's escorting Lady Eleonora?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.91,0:19:16.05,main,LADY 3,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:18.47,main,LORD 1,0,0,0,,I heard she had trouble with her carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.47,0:19:20.60,main,LADY 4,0,0,0,,His Highness gave her a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:22.77,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,But she shooed away Aida.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:25.02,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,What's her angle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:30.48,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,Our eyes met?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.99,0:19:35.74,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,He's coming over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.65,0:19:45.62,main,AIDA,0,0,0,,Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.58,0:19:58.09,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,If you were watching, \Nthat makes things simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.09,0:20:00.09,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Lady Aida Ametis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:07.82,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I, Renato di Rubini, first prince \Nof the Kingdom of Rubini,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:12.36,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,hereby call off our engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.55,0:20:22.98,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,Why is this prince telling me \Nhe's calling off his engagement to Aida?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.62,0:20:27.62,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Brother, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:30.14,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You've been fooled, Placido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:33.26,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,She's jealous of my relationship \Nwith Lady Eleonora
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.26,0:20:37.13,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,and has been following her around \Nand committing violence against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.13,0:20:40.76,main,ELEONAR,0,0,0,,Your Highness, that's not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.33,0:20:44.97,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I won't allow someone to use their \Nstatus to look down on others!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:47.67,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Please calm down, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.67,0:20:50.14,main,PLACIDO,0,0,0,,Aida isn't that kind of woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.14,0:20:51.73,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, Placido,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:54.46,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,my aide has gathered evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:54.90,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HD3D654&\3c&H9253B3&\shad0\fs25}PA{\c&H44E7E5&}NIC
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:20:57.73,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,You can't talk your way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.73,0:21:00.89,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,I command you to withdraw \Nfrom the academy immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.89,0:21:04.03,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,and apologize to \NLady Eleonora here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.03,0:21:05.33,main,LADY 1,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:06.60,main,LADY 2,0,0,0,,He called off their engagement?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.60,0:21:07.53,main,LORD 1,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:10.04,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.55,0:21:14.04,italics,MARIA/ID,0,0,0,,Aida...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:16.59,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H030F15&\3c&H25FFF7&\shad0\bord3}BLAZE
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:16.59,flashback,MARIA,0,0,0,,I'll protect Aida with all my might!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.93,0:21:20.13,flashback,AIDA,0,0,0,,I told him you're my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:26.68,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.68,0:21:29.95,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Do you understand what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:31.85,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,O-Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.85,0:21:35.19,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,No, you understand nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:40.60,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,My name is Maria Annovazzi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.60,0:21:44.37,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,Your fiancée, Lady Aida Ametis, \Nis over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:48.66,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,The first thing you should do is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:50.77,main,MARIA,0,0,0,,buy some glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.25,0:21:53.13,main,RENATO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:25.00,sign_TimesNewRoman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs15}Translation: Sho Stifler\NTiming: Mariana Martinez\NEditing: Alicia Ashby\NQuality Control: Ashley Barboza\NFinal Quality Control: Michelle Tymon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.01,0:23:25.97,sign_TrebuchetMS,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H5450C8&\3c&HFFFCFF&}BONK BONK BONK
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.82,0:23:30.81,main,MARIA/NA,0,0,0,,My name is Maria Annovazzi. Call me Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.81,0:23:33.77,main,MARIA/NA,0,0,0,,How do you get Mimi from Maria?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.77,0:23:36.63,main,MARIA/NA,0,0,0,,That's not a secret I can reveal here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.63,0:23:39.02,main,MARIA/NA,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I said that out loud again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.02,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs19\3c&HF4F3FC&}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.02,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(319,260)\fs22\c&H080600&\bord0\shad0}How I {\c&HD29E5C&}Caught {\c&H161622&}the {\c&H8A74F6&}One {\c&H161622&}That Got Away
